   "widgets_values": [
    "CREATURE - form choice.\nAnthropomorphic (default): keeps a humanoid body so costumes/jewellery fit - a person with animal traits; use for characters.\nFeral / full creature: drops human clothing, makeup, jewellery and renders the full animal/beast; use for non-humanoid subjects.\nPrefer Anthropomorphic unless you want the animal itself.\nSome species require Feral."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
