   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "IDENTITY FORGE - the character engine.\nEvery field is Random (roll) / a value (lock) / None (omit).\nSeed auto-randomizes each queue; set fixed to reproduce.\naccessory_density: drop to Minimal/None for clean portraits.\nsize_scale: manual only (Auto default, never random) - force giant/tiny.\nPreset nodes (Cosplayer/Archetype/Creature/Modifier) feed this node's archetype_json; the node CLOSEST to Identity Forge wins on overlap.\nPreset modes: Cosplayer 'Full character' vs 'Costume only'; Archetype 'Essentials' (default) vs 'Full preset' - they decide how much of the person is built."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "IDENTITY FORGE - the character engine.\nEvery field is Random (roll) / a value (lock) / None (omit).\nSeed auto-randomizes each queue; set fixed to reproduce.\naccessory_density: drop to Minimal/None for clean portraits.\nsize_scale: manual only (Auto default, never random) - force giant/tiny.\nPreset nodes (Cosplayer/Archetype/Creature/Modifier) feed this node's archetype_json; the node CLOSEST to Identity Forge wins on overlap.\nPreset modes: Cosplayer 'Full character' vs 'Costume only'; Archetype 'Essentials' (default) vs 'Full preset' - they decide how much of the person is built."
